<h1>🎨 Poppy &amp; Ziggy</h1>
<p><strong>The cartoon where a coloring page comes to life!</strong> Poppy and Ziggy pick up their crayons, color a page — and the page jumps right off the paper. Then it's games, treasure hunts, drawing, and learning while you play.</p>

<h2>Meet the crew</h2>
<p>Poppy and Ziggy lead the way, with Pip, Bones, the friendly Mummy, the T-Rex, and the parrots — Azul, Jewel, Mango, and Inca. Every adventure starts with a blank page and a box of colors. Which color will the page pick next?</p>

<h2>When to watch</h2>
<p>📺 A <strong>brand-new episode every Friday at 5 PM CT</strong> on YouTube — and a fun Short every day.</p>
